Z||000019||Pontiaddict||08-14-2001||01:36 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LT1 Chop Top:<BR><B>How do blind people know when they are done wiping??</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>There's a pretty good seeing eye dog or white cane joke here.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><B>Why don't you get a ticket when you use a handicapped toilet??</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Keep your mouth shut about that or it might happen. Why are the handycap toilets usually the farthest ones away? Maybe that's why they need the closer parking spaces.<P><BR>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by annieL:<BR><B>Why do you drive on a parkway but park in a driveway?????????<P>Anyone?????????</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Most of the parkways I've been on were aptly named. Traffic sucks.<p>[This message has been edited by Pontiaddict (edited 08-14-2001).]||||reg||1
